cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference this tool or the verification criteria it defines, please cite it as below."
title: "dsh-plugin-doctor: static, contract and sandbox-smoke verification criteria for DeepSeek Harness plugins"
abstract: >-
  dsh-plugin-doctor is a zero-dependency checker for DeepSeek Harness (dsh)
  plugins, and the specification of the verification criteria it implements.
  One run covers four layers: static package-structure checks (R0-R8), Cordis v4
  contract scans (K1-K9), a keyless-headless sandbox smoke (D0-D3, D9), and
  ecosystem directory-listing checks (CC1-CC5). The criteria are authored by
  PerryLink; SPEC.md in the repository is their normative text.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "PerryLink"
    website: "https://github.com/PerryLink"
repository-code: "https://github.com/PerryLink/dsh-plugin-doctor"
url: "https://github.com/PerryLink/dsh-plugin-doctor"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - deepseek-harness
  - dsh
  - dsh-plugin
  - cordis
  - plugin-verification
  - conformance
  - continuous-integration
